## Status

Both endpoint packages require rigorous high-precision (≥77 decimal places)
evaluation of transcendental functions at specific rational points.  The
exact missing analytic lemmas are identified below as sorry'd statements.

### Omega endpoint — missing analytic lemmas:

1. `neg_euler_mascheroni_sub_log_pi_lower` / `_upper`: tight bounds on
